    "rating": 4.1,
    "reference": "ChIJaUiK6RI4yUwRjC6bzimZdb4",
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Evelyne Desjardins",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106918986919636279240/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXERoUwCdUdoSHhKesI7mneNr2C6grmFAdYb1O7saL2Btb9kgyP=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "I went there for my wedding nails. I asked for ombré nails but I did not want the nails too long because I was playing a song at my wedding. I asked them to keep them as short as possible. They said no. I tried to explain why. They wouldn't listen.\nI asked for a pink to white ombré. They didn't understand and put random colours although I showed a picture. When I asked them to redo with pink they got annoyed at me.\nThen the guy explained how I was supposed to place my hands inside the UV light. But it was very poorly explained so I didn't understand. The owner grabbed my hand and started yelling at me.\nThey ended up charging me $100. For too long and slightly off colored nails. It was a terrible experience. I felt humiliated and disrespected. And it should've been a pleasant wedding experience. After they yelled at me, the other girls in the salon were looking at me and felt sorry. Noone was talking. It was so incredibly awkward.\nWon't return. Ever. And will inform everyone I know not to go there",
        "time": 1763255599,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Gabrielle Bucchianico",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103299898085728328816/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXMtsE4-tHhzzRrrJbzlJPu-wS3EiTrmKNt_Q6vj5V-PgHU6gXt=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "It was my first time coming here and I did a mani & pedi , the technique they use for the mani is actually the most proper way to, I had seen it when I went to my friends nail tech school , so I know that they are legit ! Also I noticed they always have new tools they are opening the package in front of us = amazing!! And the pedicure was ELITE she massaged my foot too which felt great !! She also gave me advice on how to take care of my nails ! 100% would recommend 👌🏼👌🏼✨",
        "time": 1759165000,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Valerie Tran",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116474972450108098080/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocII5GQyOpfIyjUgCjl-vq94-2gDgvufOUKH4dTQrK8rLQnT3w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "The  pedicure and manicure are really relaxing and I love the staffs you can start talking and you will start I conversation with them and sometimes they can even relate, Definitely coming back",
        "time": 1763217588,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Marie Jeanne",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110403466571802537613/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUK-EdsqrFsFbb-hV3TqQh957CnyO1n7Tqsq3jiiiRCiPMCu7Haig=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
        "text": "It’s been almost a year that I’m doing my nails there and they are amazing. They are super nice and caring about their customers. I really love this place and I will suggest it if your looking for nice and competent staff :)",
        "time": 1755528726,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "BLANCA B",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101371246070320355284/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU2M0TPP1dQPA3wFY3TaDwwdzPbRzYtK8HfLi_flG5bZhjUhJw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "As a new résident of Île Perrot I went once to do my manucure last week (August 2025). I had a “fair”manucure service but really nothing special other than the fact they have their little daughter “working” with them…  But one of the high light to me, was how rude the gentleman was, making you feel you are begging for their service and not treating you as a welcomed and respected CUSTOMER.\nIf you are considering to do your nails there, I strongly recommend you to think 🤔 twice and observe how he treats his wife and daughter..",
        "time": 1755980973,
        "translated": false
      }
    ],
